    <string name="help_topic_1_title">1. Pehli khareedari kaise likhein</string>
    <string name="help_topic_1_desc">Home screen par \'Saman Khareedna\' tap karein. Category choose karein, Model aur IMEI daalein, Seller detail aur payment add kar ke Save karein.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_2_title">2. Item kaise bechein</string>
    <string name="help_topic_2_desc">Home screen par \'Saman Bechna\' tap karein. Stock se phone select karein, Customer detail, sale price aur received amount daal kar Save karein.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_3_title">3. Baqi (udhaar) kaise rakhein</string>
    <string name="help_topic_3_desc">Khareedate ya bechte waqt jab poori payment na aaye to baqi amount khud calculate ho jaati hai. Wahan \'Baqi kab denge?\' date set karein.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_4_title">4. Customer se baad mein paisay kaise lein</string>
    <string name="help_topic_4_desc">Home -&gt; \'Khata / Ledger\' kholein. Customer ke naam par tap karein aur \'Paisay lein\' button daba kar amount record karein.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_5_title">5. Purana phone exchange</string>
    <string name="help_topic_5_desc">Home par \'Exchange\' tap karein. Purana phone ki buy detail aur naya phone ki sale detail ek hi screen par bharein.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_6_title">6. Staff code kaise add karein</string>
    <string name="help_topic_6_desc">Settings -&gt; Team -&gt; \'Invite Code Copy\' karein aur staff ko WhatsApp par bhejein. Staff app mein code daal kar join karega.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_7_title">7. Munafa kahan dikhega (Owner)</string>
    <string name="help_topic_7_desc">Home top bar par Settings ke saath Dashboard icon tap karein. Un mein \'Is mahine ka munafa\' card par poora hisaab dikhega.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_today_sales_title">Aaj ki sales ka matlab?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_today_sales_msg">Aaj subah se le kar ab tak jitni bhi mobile sales hui hain un ka kul jor.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_profit_title">Munafa (Profit) kaise banta hai?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_profit_msg">Is mahine ki Kul Sale − Khareedari ki qeemat − Shop ke kharch (Rent, Bijli, Repair).</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_capital_title">Band paisa kya hai?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_capital_msg">Shop ke available stock mein jitni phones paday hain un ki kul khareedari ki qeemat.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_slow_stock_title">Slow Stock kya hai?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_slow_stock_msg">Jo mobile phones 30 din se zyada shop mein paday hain aur bechay nahi gaye.</string>
